stroke mortality and air pollution: new evidence from Shanghai, China</article-title><source>J Occup Health</source><year>2003</year><volume>45</volume><fpage>321</fpage><lpage>323</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14646274</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1539/joh.45.321</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tsai</surname><given-names>SS</given-names></name><name><surname>Goggins</surname><given-names>WB</given-names></name><name><surname>Chiu</surname><given-names>HF</given-names></name><name><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>CY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Evidence for an association between air pollution and daily stroke admissions in Kaohsiung, Taiwan</article-title><source>Stroke</source><year>2003</year><volume>34</volume><fpage>2612</fpage><lpage>2616</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14551399</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/01.STR.0000095564.33543.64</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Maheswaran</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Haining</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name><name><surname>Brindley</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Law</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Pearson</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Fryers</surname><given-names>PR</given-names></name><name><surname>Wise</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Campbell</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Outdoor air pollution and stroke in Sheffield, United Kingdom: A small-area level geographical study</article-title><source>Stroke</source><year>2005</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>239</fpage><lpage>243</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15604422</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1161/01.STR.0000151363.71221.12</pub-